><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove\" title=\"Treasure of Crystal Cove\">Treasure of Crystal Cove</a></b>, Turn in at <a href=\"/page/Dusty_Old_Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove\" title=\"Dusty Old Treasure of Crystal Cove\">Dusty Old Treasure of Crystal Cove</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/page/Upgradeable_-_Tier_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Upgradeable - Tier 1\">Upgradeable - Tier 1</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spike-Studded\" title=\"Spike-Studded\">Spike-Studded</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spike-Studded\" title=\"Spike-Studded\">Spike-Studded</a>:</b> This item is reinforced with metal studs that improve your unarmed strikes. Your unarmed attacks do an additional 1 to 4 piercing damage.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Strength\" title=\"Strength\"> Strength +5</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Strength\" title=\"Strength\"> Strength +5</a></b>: This item gives the wearer the power of Ogre Strength, granting a +5 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Strength.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Glass_Jaw_Strike\" title=\"Glass Jaw Strike\">Glass Jaw Strike</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Glass_Jaw_Strike\" title=\"Glass Jaw Strike\">Glass Jaw Strike</a>:</b> While wearing this item, when you roll a 20 on an unarmed attack, you will deal a tremendous blow to your target that will daze it (as the <a href=\"/page/Sap\" title=\"Sap\">Sap</a> ability) and may knock it down as well.</span></span>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/page/Upgradeable_-_Tier_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Upgradeable - Tier 2\">Upgradeable - Tier 2</a>\n<ul><li>Adds <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Sneak_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sneak Attack Bonus\">  Sneak Attack Bonus +4</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Sneak_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sneak Attack Bonus\">  Sneak Attack Bonus +4</a></b>&#160;: Provides a +4 Enhancement modifier to your attack bonus and a +6 Enhancement bonus to damage for any attack that would qualify as a Sneak Attack, even if the wielder is not a Rogue.</span></span></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Upgradeable_-_Tier_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Upgradeable - Tier 3\">Upgradeable - Tier 3</a>\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Strength\" title=\"Strength\"> Strength +5</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Strength\" title=\"Strength\"> Strength +5</a></b>: This item gives the wearer the power of Ogre Strength, granting a +5 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Strength.</span></span> &#8594; <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Strength\" title=\"Strength\"> Strength +6</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Strength\" title=\"Strength\"> Strength +6</a></b>: This item gives the wearer the power of Ogre Strength, granting a +6 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Strength.</span></span></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Brawling_Gloves_(Level_16)_(Tier_1).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Brawling_Gloves_%28Level_16%29_%28Tier_1%29.png/420px-Brawling_Gloves_%28Level_16%29_%28Tier_1%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"361\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Brawling_Gloves_%28Level_16%29_%28Tier_1%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\"><a href=\"/page/Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove\" title=\"Treasure of Crystal Cove\">Treasure of Crystal Cove</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>Some pirates prefer to brawl with their bare hands.  These strength-enhancing gloves are perfect for their fighting style.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li>See also: <a href=\"/page/Brawling_Gloves\" title=\"Brawling Gloves\">Brawling Gloves</a> - Full table of the Swashbuckler line</li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">Tier 2<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Brawling_Gloves_(Level_16)_(Tier_2).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.